ermediate"><addressbook><name>AHAGON, AKIRA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUKUMOTO, AKEMI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NOBUE, TOMOTAKA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TANI, TOMOKO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHINO, KOJI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>This invention relates to a highly controllable variable-impedance unit with a compact configuration, a microwave device having the variable-impedance unit, and a microwave heater. The variable-impedance unit (10) comprises a rectangular waveguide body (11) composed of a metallic material, an open end (12) that acts on the microwave in the microwave space, a terminal end (13) terminated by a metallic material, a rotating member (14) composed of a nonmetallic material, and means (17) for driving the rotating member. The position or angle of the rotating member (14) is adjusted to vary the impedance of the open end (12), thereby varying the standing wave distribution in the microwave space.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur une unité à impédance variable à réglage fin et de configuration compacte, sur un dispositif l'utilisant, et sur un four à micro-ondes. L'unité à impédance variable (10) comprend un guide d'ondes (11) métallique rectangulaire, une extrémité ouverte (12) agissant sur les micro-ondes de l'espace des micro-ondes, une extrémité finale (13) terminée par un matériau métallique, un élément tournant (14) d'un matériau non métallique, un moyen (17) d'entraînement de l'élément tournant. La position ou l'angle de l'élément tournant (14) se règlent pour faire varier l'impédance de l'extrémité ouverte (12), et par là, la distribution des ondes stationnaires dans l'espace des micro-ondes.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>